# Reason: fresh NFC logs show PHN JNI cannot load libnfc-nci.so; source audit found the PHN JNI NativeNfcManager contract differs from BZI6 Java (72 vs 54 native declarations).
# Affected: existing NFC customization, finalization, M4 ext4 image verifier, plus a profile-scoped source/work helper and lock.
# Verify: extract/hash the JNI embedded in BZI6 capex, verify exact PHN source hash and APEX/SecNfc donor hashes, ensure no system JNI shadow, run Python/Bash syntax and patch replay fixtures. Live namespace/JNI/HAL/tag checks remain pending.
# Rollback: reverse this patch and rebuild M4 work tree; no source firmware or device partition is modified.

